        "parameters": {
          "content": "## SW: Log to Automations Log Sheet\n\n**Subworkflow.** Inserts one row into **Supabase** `public.os_automation_log` (replaces the Automations Log sheet tab).\n\n**Input:** `workflowName`, `contactName`, `phone`, `eventType`, `status`, `notes` (optional). **Get Config** is still merged for compatibility with callers that expect it.\n\n**Credentials:** Bind **Supabase OS Postgres** (Postgres node) to your Supabase connection string (pooler + SSL).\n\n**Output:** `{ success, data, error }`.\n\n**Critical:** In n8n **Settings** for this workflow, set **Error workflow** to **None** (empty). If it points at **SYS 00 — Global Error Notification**, a DB failure can re-trigger SYS 00, which calls this logger again and causes a Chat alert storm.",
          "height": 280,
          "width": 420,
          "color": 5
        },
